+3D coordinates $(x, y, z)$ are mapped to a 1D index in $D$ using:
+$$d(x, y, z) = ((M_y \times z) + y) \times M_x) + x$$
+where $M_x, M_y, M_z$ are the grid dimensions [S2, S3, unofficial].
 
